### ------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Library & Resource Management — REST Client sample file.
### Use the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) or IntelliJ
### HTTP Client to run individual requests with `Ctrl+Alt+R` / `Send Request`.
### All endpoints sit under http://localhost:9090/library
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------

@base = http://localhost:9090/library

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### List all assets
GET {{base}}/assets

### View the seed 3D printer (used in the spec)
GET {{base}}/assets/NUST-LIB-3DP-001

### Non-existent asset — should return 404
GET {{base}}/assets/does-not-exist

### All institutions
GET {{base}}/institutions

### Filter by institution (URL-encode spaces as %20)
GET {{base}}/institutions/University%20of%20Namibia/assets

### Filter by site
GET {{base}}/sites/Main%20Campus%20-%20Library/assets

### Overdue maintenance dashboard
GET {{base}}/maintenance/overdue

### All current loans
GET {{base}}/loans

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Mutations
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Create a new asset
POST {{base}}/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetTag": "DEMO-LAP-001",
  "name": "Demo Loan Laptop",
  "description": "Used by the demo client.",
  "institution": "Demo University",
  "site": "Main Campus - Demo Lab",
  "dateAcquired": "2024-09-01",
  "components": [],
  "schedules": [],
  "workOrders": []
}

### Duplicate create — should return 409
POST {{base}}/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetTag": "DEMO-LAP-001",
  "name": "x",
  "description": "x",
  "institution": "x",
  "site": "x",
  "dateAcquired": "2024-09-01"
}

### Update the asset
PUT {{base}}/assets/DEMO-LAP-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "AVAILABLE", "description": "Updated description" }

### Add a component
POST {{base}}/assets/DEMO-LAP-001/components
Content-Type: application/json

{ "compId": "C501", "name": "Battery Pack", "description": "60Wh lithium" }

### Add a maintenance schedule (future date)
POST {{base}}/assets/DEMO-LAP-001/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{ "scheduleId": "SCH-501", "type": "MAINTENANCE", "dueDate": "2027-01-15", "description": "Annual checkup" }

### Open a work order
POST {{base}}/assets/DEMO-LAP-001/workorders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "WO-501",
  "status": "OPEN",
  "description": "Battery not holding charge",
  "tasks": [
    { "taskId": "T1", "description": "Run battery diagnostics", "completed": false }
  ]
}

### Add a sub-task
POST {{base}}/assets/DEMO-LAP-001/workorders/WO-501/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "taskId": "T2", "description": "Order replacement battery", "completed": false }

### Loan the asset
POST {{base}}/assets/DEMO-LAP-001/loan
Content-Type: application/json

{ "borrower": "Jane Doe", "expectedReturnDate": "2026-12-01" }

### Return it
POST {{base}}/assets/DEMO-LAP-001/checkin

### Book a room
POST {{base}}/assets/DEMO-LAP-001/book
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "Study Group", "scheduledDate": "2026-09-10", "purpose": "Midterm prep" }

### Delete the demo asset
DELETE {{base}}/assets/DEMO-LAP-001
